  "summary": "Preinstall downloads Bun runtime and executes obfuscated bundle at install time",
  "details": "The package's package.json declares a preinstall hook `node setup.mjs`. setup.mjs downloads the Bun runtime (bun-v1.3.13) from GitHub releases and uses it to execFileSync a bundled sibling file `math_init.js` — a 727KB Bun-compiled bundle with shuffled string-array obfuscation (`WV8StW` push/shift rotator, `_0x...` identifiers) — during npm install. The obfuscated payload is unrelated to the package's stated React/docs/UI purpose, and running it under a separately downloaded runtime bypasses Node-based inspection. The package name `@servicetitan/docs-anvil-uikit-contrib` closely mirrors the real `@servicetitan/anvil-uikit-contrib` repository referenced in package.json, and the description field is empty, consistent with an impersonation of the legitimate ServiceTitan scope.",
